osted download is slow:** that deployment is intentionally small and runs from an old laptop. The terminal or Android local flow will normally be faster because it writes directly to your device."},"157":{"id":"/docs/products/holen-66","page_id":"/docs/products/holen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/holen#develop","content":"Clone the repo and follow its environment file and component-specific instructions:"},"158":{"id":"/docs/products/holen-67","page_id":"/docs/products/holen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/holen#develop","content":"The repository is split into `frontend`, `backend`, Android production files, and deployment helpers. It includes `.env.example`, Docker configuration, tests, and contribution/security docs. Do not commit local environment values or release signing material."},"159":{"id":"/docs/products/holen-68","page_id":"/docs/products/holen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/holen#links","content":"Website"},"160":{"id":"/docs/products/holen-69","page_id":"/docs/products/holen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/holen#links","content":"HOLEN GitHub repository"},"161":{"id":"/docs/products/holen-70","page_id":"/docs/products/holen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/holen#links","content":"HOLEN Releases"},"162":{"id":"/docs/products/holen-71","page_id":"/docs/products/holen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/holen#links","content":"Android source"},"163":{"id":"/docs/products/holen-72","page_id":"/docs/products/holen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/holen#links","content":"Terminal client repo"},"164":{"id":"/docs/products/img-gen","page_id":"/docs/products/img-gen","type":"page","content":"Img-gen","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Products"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/img-gen"},"165":{"id":"/docs/products/img-gen-0","page_id":"/docs/products/img-gen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/img-gen","content":"Drop an image in, get the background out — withou