e":"text","url":"/docs/products/img-gen#browser-support","content":"Yes"},"220":{"id":"/docs/products/img-gen-55","page_id":"/docs/products/img-gen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/img-gen#browser-support","content":"WebGPU can be several times faster depending on the GPU. WASM works on more machines but will feel slower on large images."},"221":{"id":"/docs/products/img-gen-56","page_id":"/docs/products/img-gen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/img-gen#privacy-performance-and-limits","content":"The image stays in the browser during normal processing. The first visit still downloads the model weights, and the hosted page itself can fetch static assets. The app does not send your photo to a background-removal server."},"222":{"id":"/docs/products/img-gen-57","page_id":"/docs/products/img-gen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/img-gen#privacy-performance-and-limits","content":"Segmentation quality depends on the image and the model. Hair, transparent objects, reflections, and cluttered backgrounds can produce imperfect edges. Large images may use significant RAM, especially on mobile devices."},"223":{"id":"/docs/products/img-gen-58","page_id":"/docs/products/img-gen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/img-gen#troubleshooting","content":"**The model never loads:** use a current browser, open the HTTPS site instead of a `file://` URL, and check that an extension or network filter is not blocking Hugging Face model assets."},"224":{"id":"/docs/products/img-gen-59","page_id":"/docs/products/img-gen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/img-gen#troubleshooting","content":"**It is slow:** check whether WebGPU is available, close other heavy tabs, or use a smaller input. WASM is a valid fallback but slower."},"225":{"id":"/docs/products/img-gen-60","page_id":"/docs/products/img-gen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/img-gen#troubleshooting","content":"**The output has a rough edge:** this is model behavior, not a file-format problem. Try a clearer subject/background separation or clean up the PNG in an editor."},"226":{"id":"/docs/products/img-gen-61","page_id":"/docs/products/img-gen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/img-gen#troubleshooting","content":"**It asks to download the model again:** browser storage may have been cleared or the page origin changed. Let it finish once; later runs should use the cache."},"227":{"id":"/docs/products/img-gen-62","page_id":"/docs/products/img-gen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/img-gen#run-locally","content":"Then open `http://localhost:3000`. The repo's `_headers` file enables cross-origin isolation on Cloudflare Pages, which helps unlock WASM multi-threading."},"228":{"id":"/docs/products/img-gen-63","page_id":"/docs/products/img-gen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/img-gen#links","content":"Hosted app"},"229":{"id":"/docs/products/img-gen-64","page_id":"/docs/products/img-gen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/img-gen#links","content":"GitHub repository"},"230":{"id":"/docs/products/img-gen-65","page_id":"/docs/products/img-gen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/img-gen#links","content":"RMBG-1.4 model"},"231":{"id":"/docs/products/img-gen-66","page_id":"/docs/products/img-gen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/img-gen#links","content":"ONNX Runtime Web"},"232":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","type":"page","content":"localhost","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Products"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/localhost"},"233":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-0","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/localhost","content":"A tiny public window into what is running at home."},"234":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-1","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/localhost#what-it-is","content":"What it is"},"235":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-2","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/localhost#use-it","content":"Use it"},"236":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-3","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/localhost#how-it-works","content":"How it works"},"237":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-4","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/localhost#tech-stack","content":"Tech stack"},"238":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-5","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/localhost#privacy-and-limitations","content":"Privacy and limitations"},"239":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-6","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/localhost#troubleshooting","content":"Troubleshooting"},"240":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-7","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/localhost#develop","content":"Develop"},"241":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-8","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/localhost#links","content":"Links"},"242":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-9","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/localhost#what-it-is","content":"The localhost dashboard is a tiny public window into the services I run at home. It checks the configured endpoints and answers the important question: “is the thing on?”"},"243":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-10","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/localhost#what-it-is","content":"**Current status:** Live."},"244":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-11","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/localhost#use-it","content":"Open the status page. The service list shows the latest reachability result exposed by the dashboard. An “online” result means the status checker could reach the service from the machine running the check; it does not guarantee that every network or user can reach the service."},"245":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-12","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/localhost#how-it-works","content":"The public page is intentionally just a status view. The checker runs from the host where the services are reachable, which avoids pretending that a service is healthy based only on a browser running somewhere else."},"246":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-13","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/localhost#tech-stack","content":"The public dashboard is a lightweight static JavaScript/CSS site, with a small serverless status endpoint in `functions/api/localhost-status.js`. The surrounding personal dashboard is deployed as static web assets and Cloudflare Pages/Workers functions. The exact service list and deployment configuration live in the dashboard repository."},"247":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-14","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/localhost#privacy-and-limitations","content":"This page reports reachability, not a full monitoring/SLO system. It does not replace logs, uptime history, alerting, or health checks inside each service. Do not expose credentials or private service URLs in the public configuration. A service can be online from the checker host and still be blocked from the public internet by NAT, firewall, or DNS."},"248":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-15","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/localhost#troubleshooting","content":"**Everything is offline:** check that the host is running, the local service ports are listening, and the status function can reach them. Then check DNS and the tunnel/reverse-proxy path."},"249":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-16","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/localhost#troubleshooting","content":"**One service is offline:** inspect that service's process and port first. A status failure is often the useful first signal, not the root cause."},"250":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-17","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/localhost#troubleshooting","content":"**The page is stale:** refresh the page and inspect the endpoint response. If the endpoint itself is unavailable, check the deployment logs and the host running the checks."},"251":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-18","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/localhost#develop","content":"The repository contains the public dashboard assets, the status function, and a separate `docs-site` Next.js/Fumadocs application. Keep local hostnames, tokens, and private endpoints out of public files."},"252":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-19","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/localhost#links","content":"Live status page"},"253":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-20","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/localhost#links","content":"Dashboard and status function source"},"254":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-21","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/localhost#links","content":"Status endpoint source"},"255":{"id":"/docs/products/localhost-22","page_id":"/docs/products/localhost","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/localhost#links","content":"Documentation source"},"256":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","type":"page","content":"OpenStream","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Products"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/openstream"},"257":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-0","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream","content":"Your phone is already a camera. This gets OBS to admit it."},"258":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-1","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/openstream#what-it-is","content":"What it is"},"259":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-2","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/openstream#quick-start","content":"Quick start"},"260":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-3","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/openstream#what-you-can-do-with-it","content":"What you can do with it"},"261":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-4","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/openstream#how-it-works","content":"How it works"},"262":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-5","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"Tech stack"},"263":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-6","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"Defaults and tuning"},"264":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-7","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/openstream#compatibility-and-limits","content":"Compatibility and limits"},"265":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-8","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/openstream#troubleshooting","content":"Troubleshooting"},"266":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-9","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/openstream#build-from-source","content":"Build from source"},"267":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-10","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/openstream#links","content":"Links"},"268":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-11","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#what-it-is","content":"Your phone is already a camera. OpenStream turns it into a camera and microphone source inside OBS Studio, sending the media over local Wi-Fi to a native plugin on the Windows PC."},"269":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-12","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#what-it-is","content":"This is useful for a second camera, a desk cam, a phone-on-a-tripod shot, or a multi-camera stream without running a cable across the room. There is no cloud relay in the normal setup: the phone and the OBS machine talk directly on the LAN."},"270":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-13","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#what-it-is","content":"**Current status:** Beta. The supported V1.0.1 path is the Android app plus the Windows OBS plugin over local Wi-Fi. USB transport is not part of this release."},"271":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-14","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#quick-start","content":"Install the Android APK and the Windows `openstream-obs-plugin-installer-windows-x64.exe`, then restart OBS."},"272":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-15","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#quick-start","content":"Put the phone and PC on the same normal Wi-Fi network. 5 GHz or Wi-Fi 6 is recommended."},"273":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-16","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#quick-start","content":"In OBS, choose **Sources → + → OpenStream V8** and name the camera slot."},"274":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-17","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#quick-start","content":"Open the Android app, allow camera/microphone access, and tap the slot it discovers."},"275":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-18","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#quick-start","content":"Open **Docks → OpenStream Camera Control** in OBS for lens, zoom, torch, labels, and reconnect controls."},"276":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-19","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#quick-start","content":"If discovery cannot find the PC, use manual connection and enter the PC address shown by the plugin. Guest Wi-Fi, VPNs, and router client isolation commonly block discovery."},"277":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-20","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#what-you-can-do-with-it","content":"Stream 1080p30, with a 720p30 fallback profile."},"278":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-21","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#what-you-can-do-with-it","content":"Switch between front, rear, ultrawide, and telephoto lenses when available."},"279":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-22","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#what-you-can-do-with-it","content":"Use pinch-to-zoom, torch control, and a black screen streaming overlay."},"280":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-23","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#what-you-can-do-with-it","content":"Run multiple phones by creating one stable camera slot per angle."},"281":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-24","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#what-you-can-do-with-it","content":"Flash the slot name on the phone so physical cameras are easy to identify."},"282":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-25","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#what-you-can-do-with-it","content":"Recover from short Wi-Fi drops using the plugin's reconnect hold."},"283":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-26","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#how-it-works","content":"Discovery uses UDP `51515`; media uses SRT `9000`; remote camera controls use HTTP `9001`. These ports are intended for the local network, not the public internet."},"284":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-27","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"Part"},"285":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-28","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"Technology"},"286":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-29","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"Job"},"287":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-30","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"Android app"},"288":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-31","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"Kotlin/Android, Camera2"},"289":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-32","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"Capture, preview, camera selection"},"290":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-33","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"Encoding"},"291":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-34","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"MediaCodec"},"292":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-35","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"Hardware AVC/H.264 video and AAC audio"},"293":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-36","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"Transport"},"294":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-37","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"MPEG-TS, libsrt, SRT"},"295":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-38","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"Low-latency delivery over Wi-Fi"},"296":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-39","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"OBS integration"},"297":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-40","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"Native OBS source/plugin"},"298":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-41","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"Makes each phone a normal OBS source"},"299":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-42","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"Receive/decode"},"300":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-43","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"OBS bundled FFmpeg SRT support"},"301":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-44","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"Converts the stream back to frames/audio"},"302":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-45","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"Pairing"},"303":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-46","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"LAN UDP + phone HTTP server"},"304":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-47","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"Discovery and remote controls"},"305":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-48","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"Distribution"},"306":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-49","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"GitHub Releases + Cloudflare Pages"},"307":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-50","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#tech-stack","content":"Downloads and website"},"308":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-51","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"Setting"},"309":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-52","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"Default"},"310":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-53","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"Notes"},"311":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-54","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"Resolution"},"312":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-55","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"1920×1080"},"313":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-56","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"Full HD target"},"314":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-57","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"Frame rate"},"315":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-58","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"30 fps"},"316":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-59","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"Keeps heat and backlog reasonable"},"317":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-60","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"Video codec"},"318":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-61","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"AVC/H.264"},"319":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-62","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"Hardware surface encoder"},"320":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-63","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"Bitrate"},"321":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-64","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"12 Mbps"},"322":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-65","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"Try 8–12 Mbps before changing anything else"},"323":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-66","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"SRT latency"},"324":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-67","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"120 ms"},"325":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-68","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"80–200 ms is a useful range"},"326":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-69","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#defaults-and-tuning","content":"If the phone runs hot or the feed stutters, use 720p30 and lower the bitrate. Stable Wi-Fi matters more than chasing a tiny latency number."},"327":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-70","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#compatibility-and-limits","content":"Android 10+ with Camera2 and hardware MediaCodec support is expected."},"328":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-71","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#compatibility-and-limits","content":"The OBS host is currently Windows x64 with OBS Studio 32.2.1 and bundled FFmpeg SRT support."},"329":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-72","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#compatibility-and-limits","content":"Devices must see each other on the same LAN/subnet."},"330":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-73","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#compatibility-and-limits","content":"Camera behavior differs between manufacturers and lenses."},"331":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-74","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#compatibility-and-limits","content":"USB transport and USB camera sources are not supported in V1.0.1."},"332":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-75","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#troubleshooting","content":"**No slot appears:** check subnet, VPN, Windows Firewall, guest-network isolation, and the plugin restart. Use manual IP entry as a fallback."},"333":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-76","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#troubleshooting","content":"**Slot appears but no video:** confirm the source is enabled, the media port is open, and try 720p30. Restarting OBS after installing the plugin is important."},"334":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-77","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#troubleshooting","content":"**Delayed or glitchy feed:** use 5 GHz/Wi-Fi 6, move closer to the access point, lower bitrate, and increase SRT latency slightly."},"335":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-78","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#troubleshooting","content":"**Phone is hot:** use the black screen mode, 720p30, a lower bitrate, and keep the phone ventilated. Camera capture plus encoding is real work for a phone."},"336":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-79","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#build-from-source","content":"The repo has separate Android and OBS plugin projects. On Windows, build the Android debug APK with:"},"337":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-80","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#build-from-source","content":"The APK is in `android/app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk`. Build the plugin with `./build_plugin.bat`; set `OPENSTREAM_SKIP_INSTALL=1` to package without installing. Release signing variables and the SRT smoke test are documented in the repo."},"338":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-81","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#links","content":"Website"},"339":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-82","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#links","content":"GitHub repository"},"340":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-83","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#links","content":"Latest releases"},"341":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-84","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#links","content":"Issues"},"342":{"id":"/docs/products/openstream-85","page_id":"/docs/products/openstream","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/openstream#links","content":"Screenshot setup guide"},"343":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","type":"page","content":"Wisper Low","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Products"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/wisper-low"},"344":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-0","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low","content":"Dictation that keeps its ears on your machine."},"345":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-1","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#what-it-is","content":"What it is"},"346":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-2","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#quick-start","content":"Quick start"},"347":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-3","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#how-it-works","content":"How it works"},"348":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-4","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Tech stack"},"349":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-5","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#useful-controls","content":"Useful controls"},"350":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-6","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#privacy-and-model-choices","content":"Privacy and model choices"},"351":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-7","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#troubleshooting","content":"Troubleshooting"},"352":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-8","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#build-from-source","content":"Build from source"},"353":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-9","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#links","content":"Links"},"354":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-10","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#what-it-is","content":"I wanted dictation without renting my microphone to a cloud service. Press a shortcut, speak, release it, and Wisper Low pastes the words into whichever app was active."},"355":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-11","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#what-it-is","content":"The repository currently contains the wider Handy desktop implementation, so you may see “Handy” in the source, releases, and build docs. The important idea is the same: an open, extensible, offline speech-to-text desktop app."},"356":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-12","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#what-it-is","content":"**Current status:** Prototype. Expect model download time, microphone quirks, shortcut conflicts, and platform-specific rough edges."},"357":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-13","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#quick-start","content":"Download the available installer from the GitHub releases page."},"358":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-14","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#quick-start","content":"Launch the app and grant microphone and accessibility/input permissions when your OS asks."},"359":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-15","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#quick-start","content":"Use `Ctrl+Alt+P` or `Ctrl+Alt+Space` to start dictation."},"360":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-16","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#quick-start","content":"Speak, then press the same shortcut to stop and paste the result."},"361":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-17","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#quick-start","content":"Press `Ctrl+Alt+Backspace` to cancel without pasting."},"362":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-18","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#quick-start","content":"On macOS and Linux the exact release and permission flow can differ. Read the repo's build and platform notes before assuming a Windows shortcut will be identical everywhere."},"363":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-19","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#how-it-works","content":"Voice Activity Detection (VAD) reduces the amount of silence sent to inference. You can choose from Whisper-family models or the CPU-focused Parakeet V3 path. An optional Ollama-based post-process can clean up wording, but the core transcription remains local."},"364":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-20","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Part"},"365":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-21","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Technology"},"366":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-22","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Job"},"367":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-23","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Desktop shell"},"368":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-24","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Tauri"},"369":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-25","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Small cross-platform native app shell"},"370":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-26","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Settings UI"},"371":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-27","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS"},"372":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-28","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Configuration and status screens"},"373":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-29","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"System backend"},"374":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-30","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Rust"},"375":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-31","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Native integration, audio, and ML orchestration"},"376":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-32","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Speech models"},"377":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-33","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"whisper.cpp GGML/GGUF, transcribe-rs/Parakeet"},"378":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-34","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Offline transcription paths"},"379":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-35","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Audio"},"380":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-36","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"cpal + rubato"},"381":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-37","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Cross-platform capture and resampling"},"382":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-38","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Silence detection"},"383":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-39","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"vad-rs / Silero VAD"},"384":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-40","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Avoids processing long silence"},"385":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-41","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Global input"},"386":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-42","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"rdev"},"387":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-43","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Keyboard shortcuts and system events"},"388":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-44","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Optional cleanup"},"389":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-45","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Ollama"},"390":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-46","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#tech-stack","content":"Local rewrite/post-processing when enabled"},"391":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-47","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#useful-controls","content":"The default toggle shortcuts are `Ctrl+Alt+P` and `Ctrl+Alt+Space`; configure them in settings if another program already owns them. `Ctrl+Alt+Backspace` cancels the current capture. The full Handy build also exposes command-line controls such as `--toggle-transcription`, `--toggle-post-process`, `--start-hidden`, `--no-tray`, and `--debug`."},"392":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-48","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#useful-controls","content":"On Wayland, global shortcuts are often best configured in your desktop environment or window manager to run `handy --toggle-transcription`. Text input may need `wtype` or `dotool`."},"393":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-49","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#privacy-and-model-choices","content":"Audio is processed locally by the selected model. If you enable Ollama cleanup, that request still goes to your own Ollama instance, not a hosted YashasVM service. Model quality, speed, and memory use trade off against each other: smaller models respond faster; larger models tend to transcribe more accurately but need more resources."},"394":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-50","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#troubleshooting","content":"**Nothing happens on the shortcut:** check microphone/accessibility permission and whether another app owns the key combination. On Wayland, add the shortcut in the compositor/desktop settings."},"395":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-51","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#troubleshooting","content":"**Text is not inserted:** install the appropriate `wtype` (Wayland) or `xdotool` (X11), or use the clipboard-based fallback. The active app also needs a normal editable text field."},"396":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-52","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#troubleshooting","content":"**Transcription is slow:** use a smaller model, close other CPU/GPU-heavy apps, or try the Parakeet CPU path. First-run model loading can be much slower than later runs."},"397":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-53","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#troubleshooting","content":"**The app crashes:** enable debug mode and attach logs plus OS, model, audio device, and GPU details to an issue. Prototype model crashes can be configuration-specific."},"398":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-54","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#build-from-source","content":"The exact platform prerequisites are maintained in BUILD.md. Clone the repository first:"},"399":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-55","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#build-from-source","content":"The source includes the Tauri frontend, Rust backend, model integrations, and platform-specific packaging. Keep downloaded model files out of commits."},"400":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-56","page_id":"/docs/products/wisper-low","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/wisper-low#links","content":"Website"},"401":{"id":"/docs/products/wisper-low-57","page_id":"/docs/products/