","page_id":"/docs/products/yt-cmd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/yt-cmd#what-it-is","content":"`yt-cmd` is the terminal piece of HOLEN. It wraps `yt-dlp` in a small interactive prompt so you can paste a URL, pick video or audio, choose quality, and skip memorising a wall of flags."},"414":{"id":"/docs/products/yt-cmd-9","page_id":"/docs/products/yt-cmd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/yt-cmd#what-it-is","content":"The npm package is currently called `holen-dl`. The older command names still work."},"415":{"id":"/docs/products/yt-cmd-10","page_id":"/docs/products/yt-cmd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/yt-cmd#run-it","content":"Aliases:"},"416":{"id":"/docs/products/yt-cmd-11","page_id":"/docs/products/yt-cmd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/yt-cmd#run-it","content":"Choose from quality presets or a custom resolution, then select MP4, MKV, or MP3. Video downloads prefer MP4 and can fall back to MKV; audio downloads are MP3. Files are saved to `~/Downloads`."},"417":{"id":"/docs/products/yt-cmd-12","page_id":"/docs/products/yt-cmd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/yt-cmd#tech-stack-and-flow","content":"Part"},"418":{"id":"/docs/products/yt-cmd-13","page_id":"/docs/products/yt-cmd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/yt-cmd#tech-stack-and-flow","content":"Technology"},"419":{"id":"/docs/products/yt-cmd-14","page_id":"/docs/products/yt-cmd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/yt-cmd#tech-stack-and-flow","content":"Runtime/distribution"},"420":{"id":"/docs/products/yt-cmd-15","page_id":"/docs/products/yt-cmd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/yt-cmd#tech-stack-and-flow","content":"Node.js and npm"},"421":{"id":"/docs/products/yt-cmd-16","page_id":"/docs/products/yt-cmd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/products/yt-cmd#tech-stack-and-flow","content":"Source support"},"422":{"id":"/docs/products/yt-cmd-17","page_id":"/docs/products/yt-cmd","tags":[],"type":"text","ur